WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.155 --> 00:00:09.610
Press F3 to open the Session view. Each column is a playlist track, and each row is a scene.

2
00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:12.849
Click a scene's play button to launch the whole row.

3
00:00:13.261 --> 00:00:17.348
Launch single clips to bring in more parts. They start on the next bar.

4
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:26.479
Stop all stops every track. Back to arrangement hands them back to your song.

5
00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:31.804
Right-click a clip to set a follow action, like jumping to the next clip after eight bars.

6
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:38.201
Turn on Record to arrangement, launch a scene, and when you stop, your jam is written into the Playlist.
